  destinations:
  - destinationName: Yellowstone
    description: 'Colorful geothermal springs bubble from the earth.

      Towering
      forests surround vast wilderness landscapes.

      Wildlife roams freely across
      open valleys.

      Steam rises from remarkable natural formations.

      Adventure
      awaits throughout this iconic park.'
    background: {fileID: 6522214001781614436, guid: c75d96e1f5b2944dfb9b5075d84ac611, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Yosemite
    description: Granite cliffs tower above lush green valleys. Waterfalls cascade
      from dramatic mountain heights. Ancient forests thrive beneath towering peaks.
      Scenic trails reveal breathtaking natural beauty. Every view inspires wonder
      and exploration.
    background: {fileID: 8352207676642407152, guid: a18cb6361731443b7b112a6456250ff6, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Central Park
    description: Tree-lined paths wind through the heart of the city. Open lawns
      provide peaceful urban escapes. Historic bridges overlook tranquil lakes. Seasonal
      colors transform the landscape year-round. Nature flourishes amid the city
      skyline.
    background: {fileID: 1347874701817358295, guid: d4f6a3923e2b44f80aaecae397722314, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Golden Gate Bridge
    description: A world-famous bridge spans sparkling coastal waters. Rolling hills
      frame spectacular bay views. Ocean breezes sweep across the iconic landmark.
      Sunlight paints the structure in brilliant colors. A symbol of innovation and
      beauty stands tall.
    background: {fileID: 9019930629698925024, guid: 20f40cfd2221c4e029eae0fd866aa5a9, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Grand Canyon
    description: Immense rock formations stretch across the horizon. Layers of history
      reveal Earth's ancient past. Sunrise and sunset transform canyon colors. Scenic
      overlooks offer unforgettable panoramas. Nature's scale inspires awe at every
      turn.
    background: {fileID: 572881471615840430, guid: 911df33ddd532400eb1aceaed8416f6f, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Hawaii
    description: Golden beaches meet crystal-clear ocean waters. Palm trees sway
      beneath tropical skies. Volcanic landscapes create dramatic scenery. Colorful
      flowers brighten the island environment. Paradise awaits around every shoreline.
    background: {fileID: 3425971921294540518, guid: f3098cfed9af7423b98db21ad3266d5d, type: 3}
